<title>USA: Bankers Trust New York Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust New York Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.89		    $1.52</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.89		     1.51</p>
<p> Net			169,000		  138,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	82,784		   80,896</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	82,898		   81,560</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net applicable to common $156 million vs $123 million.  </p>
<p>Total net revs $1.176 bln vs $958 million.</p>
<p>Investment banking net revs $303 million vs $227 million.</p>
<p>Trading &amp; sales net revs $134 million vs $90 million.</p>
<p>Client processing services net revs $196 million vs $182 million.</p>
<p>Risk mgmt services net revs $105 million vs $63 million.</p>
<p>Net charge-offs $15 million vs $10 million.</p>
<p>Net interest revs $1.65 bln vs $1.59 bln.</p>
<p>Tier I capital ratio 8.5 pct vs 9.4 pct.</p>
</text>
